 tober 2026\, 16:00 Dutch time / 10:00 Caribbean time (an earlier 2 April 2
 026 round has already closed). Grant covers up to 70% of eligible expenses
 \, with two pricing structures: fixed €2\,480/month for short 1-6 month 
 work periods\, or a flexible grant of up to 12 months for larger project p
 lans (amount determined by submitted plan and budget). Round budget €229
