 -form writing\, podcast series\, or video essay projects. Applications sub
 mitted via the Mondriaan Fund online portal after creating an account\; do
 cuments cannot be uploaded after the deadline. Free to apply.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Mondriaan Fund\nLocation: Netherlands (applicants must be part of the
